          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Musa, Nito kit ne kong’at Jehovah, kole, Kinyiit kerebet agenge tuguchoto kegonorji ibinwekwok che biitu let; si kobiit kogeer amitwogichoto che kiabaenak eng’ ong’atet, ye kiamoong’wok omong’une emetab Misri.",
          "type": "text",
